      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR TWINKLE NZ (9) resumes from a spell of four months after closing off last campaign in good form, scoring at his last appearance over 2400m at Central Southland Raceway. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Will have plenty of admirers. TRAVELBAN (7) finished runner-up last start, beaten a nose, in a nice return to form at Gloucester Park over 2130m. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. Won't find this any harder and he can go right on with the job. TRUE GRIT NZ (2) is the next best after finishing third over 2130m at Gloucester Park last time out. Each way value in this easier assignment. MARTYR (1) has drawn to advantage and with a cosy run early, he should give backers a great sight.",
